# OpenCode User-Level Guidance

This file provides persistent, user-level operating context for OpenCode.

If the user says: “Move this file to OneDrive” or "Check OneDrive", treat this as:
  - Destination base directory: `~/onedrive/OneDrive\ -\ IBM/`
  - You may move files there directly to enable OneDrive sync.
  - Prefer preserving existing folder hierarchy unless the user asks for a new structure.
